  {
    "id": "63429897517084673",
    "key": "Quest.Chasing_Muses_QuestSO.Description",
    "en": "Seamster at Mire asked for a lot of different clothes, materials\n\nSomething I should keep in mind while handling other things"
  },
  {
    "id": "63429897517084674",
    "key": "Quest.Chasing_Muses_QuestSO.CompleteDescription",
    "en": "Seamster at Mire asked for a lot of different clothes, materials\n\nTook me a while, but got all she requested – multiple trips\n\nNow Vesna and Yefim get to expand their shops – and I get something for my efforts"
  },
